Package: assignmentB2SierraBirthelmer
Title: Summarize Unique Participants in Repeated Measures Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a function for summarizing categorical participant
    characteristics in datasets containing repeated observations.
    Counts unique participants in each category and calculates
    corresponding percentages, making it useful for daily diary
    and other repeated measures research.
